    "semantic_summary": "CodeWorkspaceComponent is the primary controller managing the entire code editing environment, orchestrating the display of files, active editor instances, and workspace state. It integrates services like AssetCodeService and MonacoService to handle file loading, tab management, and persistence. Its core responsibilities include managing user interactions like context menus, handling unsaved changes, and triggering full workspace compilations with visual error feedback."
